\paragraph{Effect size and downstream impact.}
The in-distribution improvement ($\Delta{=}{-}0.023$ at $\rho{=}0.4$) does not transfer to downstream accuracy (0.5414 vs.\ 0.5414, 5 seeds; Appendix~\ref{app:downstream}), consistent with nonlinear PPL-to-accuracy transfer~\citep{tay2023scale,ye2025mixing}; the paradigm's impact at current scales is modest (Appendix~\ref{app:power}).
